        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-15T20:22:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If Forced Deployment is destroyed pre-villan turn,  when exactly does it activate?</p>\n<p>For example,  if Forced Deployment is destroyed by Fueled Freeze or by End of Days, are the minions in Voss’ trash that will be deployed subject to immidiate damage/destruction from these attacks or no?</p>\n<p>Secondly,  is there any rule about the order that redeployed minions are organized in?  Can you put the guys you want to attack first at the top of the order?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:37.721Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
