        "id": 21365,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-16T00:13:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fueled Freeze can acutally still deal the damage. Due to the fact it says “Destroy up to 3 ongoing cards.” so you would destroy the three ongoing cards. Since the next phrase is on a new line, it will take place after Forced Deployment is destroyed and the minions return, so that damage will still occur. Fanatic’s End of Days however is all in one line so you’ll destroy Forced Deployment and any other card before the minions come out to play.</p>",
