        "created_at": "2011-08-16T01:26:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Huh… The programmer in me always thought it differently.  If I saw a card with a line that said “Destroy three cards” and one of the cards destroyed had an effect when being destroyed, I would have processed said action before continuing on to the next two cards.</p>",
